<title>UK: Coca-Cola Amatil sets 300 mln mark bond.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Amatil sets 300 mln mark bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COCA COLA AMATIL</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    05.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.511   PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0 PCT   REOFFER    99.836    SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325 PCT SELL CONC  1.675 PCT</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND BOBL 119  NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
